part of every package.

Excluded from release
---------------------
The experimental Kitten TTS path uses sherpa-onnx static artifacts that embed GPLv3 espeak-ng.
`experimental-gpl-tts`, sherpa-onnx, and the Kitten model are not release inputs.
See models/kitten-nano-en-v0_8-int8.toml and docs/local-mouth.md for the development-only
provenance and blocker.
